WEBVTT

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:42.580
They've got infrared sensors detecting any life forms.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:43.980
Oh?

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:48.830
It identifies all the residents of the mansion.

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:50.330
What about me?

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:52.330
Knowing how that old guy Mitsugai is,

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.880
it should be set up so you can pass through, too!

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.340
Go on in, don't be afraid.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.760
Will I really be OK?

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.310
Woah, amazing.

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:06.640
Isn't it?

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:10.810
I can pretty much guess what that old guy's up to.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:14.320
Episode 9: A Memento's Whereabouts

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:18.820
Right now, the mother and daughter
are the only ones in the main building,

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.070
Look for the daughter's room.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:25.700
We don't have time.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.580
Hurry up.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.090
I found her.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.810
Take off the suit.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:51.480
Hey.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.320
W-What?!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.410
Jin-kun?

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.160
Why are you here?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.500
Give me back my pendant.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.090
I planned on giving it back the next time I saw you.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:23.010
Give it back now.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.220
Don't be in such a hurry.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.220
Tell her it's because it's a memento from your grandfather.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.310
It's a memento from my grandfather.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:32.980
I see...

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.980
It was something really important.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:46.580
Kouga!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.330
Kaa-san!

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:55.420
Jin?!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.850
Mr. Chairman, this is-

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.600
Must be Haitani's underlings.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.610
Nice guess, brother.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.890
We were created from your blood.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.070
That's impossible!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.200
There shouldn't be a way clones
could be created from the Zet factors.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.490
That's if we're talking about the complete Zet factors.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.290
Jin's still incomplete,

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.000
so maybe that's why they were able to manufacture these.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.880
What were you guys doing in here?!

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:37.500
What about Konoha?!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.460
How about you see for yourself?

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.220
Everyone get outside!

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.640
Kill 'em.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.660
Mr. Chairman!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:26.470
Otou-sama!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.340
Mr. Chairman!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.560
Don't take your eyes off your opponent.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.940
Jin, take care of my grandfather!

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:21.810
I'm going to check on Konoha.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.480
Got it.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.450
What?

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:36.200
So it's true! You turn back into a human after the the Players die...

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.760
Hey!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:04.320
I... wanted to see... you... in your complete form.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.250
Konoha!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.410
Konoha!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.290
Onii-chan?

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.380
Are you OK?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.750
Jin-kun-

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.760
Konoha, where's the pendant?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.310
Yeah, I got the stone.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.110
The clones got the job done perfectly.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.820
You can go ahead and do it now, Otou-san.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.950
All right!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.920
Things are getting fun!

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:18.010
Where are you going?

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.890
You're headed out again?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.640
What do you care?

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.810
Think more about your public image!

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:29.150
What do the neighbours and your school think of you?

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.400
You're talking about that again?

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.280
Public image is the only thing you are worried about.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.870
We're worried about your future!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.740
Then at least give me a call!

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:43.040
You didn't call me even once.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.670
You're my parents, right?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.670
Even if we called, it's not like you'd answer the phone, anyway!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.650
Anyway? That's all I am to you?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:54.840
Hanako!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:55.800
Let her be.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.810
She'll be back soon, anyway.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:09.400
I hate people who can't get along with their families.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.830
Just like I thought, it's impossible, Jin.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.340
I can't do this anymore...

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.640
Mr. President!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:46.190
I received word from Hayami that
all of your family members are safe.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.190
And this image was just barely caught and left on the security cameras.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:51.940
Who is it?

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.650
The chairman was present as well.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.070
He might know something about this.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.830
We've lost the red stone.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:08.580
There's probably no doubt that it's in Haitani's hands now.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.540
And I feel terrible about what happened to Dr. Sugita.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:16.510
Losing his life trying to protect me...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:19.130
We all feel awful about it.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.510
Hey, why did Haitani know about the red stone?

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.810
For sure, right after we learned about it,

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.730
he was making contact with Konoha.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.730
I can only think that information's being leaked somehow.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.520
And just who are you saying is leaking the info?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.530
And there are more problems.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:39.150
Where are the funds and technology to make clones of you coming from?

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:42.570
Do Players have that much power?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.330
Is the completed form just a dream?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.330
Our opponent has obtained the red stone,

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:54.090
so perhaps he's trying to get Jin to work with the Players.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.210
I won't let him do that!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:02.470
I see the bombing of the Amagi house as a declaration of war.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.560
The fight's moved on to the next stage!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.390
Even if we don't have the red stone,

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.640
as long as Jin has the will to fight,

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.400
he definitely won't become our enemy!

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.730
Alphas will support Jin!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:17.480
I'll fight alongside him!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.740
Lift your head up, Mr. Chairman.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.240
"You won't find any hopes rolling around on the ground."

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:31.870
That's what a guy I'm indebted to told me one time.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.640
Received mail
Tanaka
I want to see you.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:57.230
I'm scared...

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:01.150
Why won't anyone tell me anything?

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.160
Sorry, Konoha-chan.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.490
We don't know anything, either.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.750
This is like that terrifying time back then...

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.370
When I was little,

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:19.500
Ojii-sama didn't forgive you for doing your volunteer work, Okaa-san.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.550
There was no reason for it, and I was scared.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:32.430
But this is a secret base that the
president and chairman don't know about.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.770
Be at ease.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.650
I can't just be at ease!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.400
With what happened at the house,

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.740
I can't feel reassured about anything!

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:47.030
The guy who came to my room wasn't Jin, was it?

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.290
It's pretty certain it wasn't him.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.160
Then who was it?!

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.330
What's special about the pendant?

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.840
Somebody... tell me...

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:25.990
Wait.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.410
Do you know this man?

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.160
That's a fake!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:33.830
What?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.620
I have to hurry, so...

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.340
Are you going to Alphas's place?

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.300
Are you OK with leaving things like this;

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:49.090
without asking your son or the chairman anything?

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.430
My father's never been one to tell me anything.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:59.480
Kouga just doesn't understand his own position.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.440
They're gone.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:04.320
Yeah.

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.570
Where are you going?

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.240
Konoha's waiting at the base.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.290
We should all stick together now!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.000
Let's have a meeting to prepare battle strategies!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.540
I'm going to meet someone.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:17.500
See you.

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:28.970
Hello.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.180
Nice to meet you.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.810
You're Kanzaki Jin-san, right?

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.180
And you are?

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.270
My apologies.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.980
Should I be calling you "Zet"?

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.690
Please relax.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.860
I just want to talk to you for a bit.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.530
You... Are you Haitani's underling?

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.820
No, you've got it backwards.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:59.290
I'm Haitani's superior and the one in control of EVOL.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.080
They call me Master!

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:06.920
I'm the first one who turned their fangs
against humans in the underground arena.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:19.520
I was told to hand over all of the data about Alphas to the main company.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.270
You can't do that!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.230
If you think about the precedent that was set due to the arson incident,

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:26.480
my father will definitely move this over to the military department!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.320
He'll do damage to Alphas's name!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.110
It can't be helped.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:35.370
The incident with the mansion's bombing is also being reported...

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:40.160
...as an act of terrorism against the Amagi Group's power of influence.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:43.630
It's an ideal reason for the Amagi Group to raise arms.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.500
How like him...

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:51.760
But right now, Alphas has been given a serious mission!

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.890
Why you?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.270
Because I'm Amagi Kouga.

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:01.270
So you're saying that since this is an Amagi scandal,

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.770
you want to clean it up from the inside?

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:08.280
I'm not fighting for such a petty reason.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:13.280
Isn't it only natural for a hero to take action to protect people?

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:18.240
I understand your thinking.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.660
I want you to leave the matter of the company in my hands.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.170
Thank you, Hayami-san!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.170
So let's get started!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.670
First up, let's take a close look at the recorded footage from the fight!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.380
Don't get worked up.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.930
As the master of EVOL,

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:38.050
I apologise for the bombing incident at the Amagi residence.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.180
So you ordered it?

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:44.350
Haitani was acting out on his own.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:49.190
He's a nuisance both to humanity and EVOL.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.820
You probably can't believe it,

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:55.030
but EVOL is a group of pacifists.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.200
Don't make me laugh.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.490
Having life is a wonderful thing.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:04.920
We're grateful to the humans for giving birth to us,

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.130
and we have no wish to fight.

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.840
We're always searching for a path to coexist.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:13.130
But Haitani's different!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:16.840
He's trying to bring destruction upon the human world.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.100
He must be stopped.

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.100
If you understand that,

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.350
why not take care of it within your organisation?

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.440
It's embarrassing to say,

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.770
but we can't compare to him.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:33.070
Furthermore, he's quite a big problem for you as well.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.990
He's scheming to turn you into your complete form...

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.160
...and use you for no good.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.620
How convenient.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.790
"The enemy of my enemy is my friend," huh?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.000
Kanzaki Jin-san.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.250
I'd like your help.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.550
All right, I'm in!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:02.080
Haitani really pisses me off, too.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:07.140
Didn't I tell you not to come to the office dressed like that?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.310
Even though our house is ruined,

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:13.150
the thing that concerns you is how I look?

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.820
We've lost a home to return to.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:20.370
Konoha's scared!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.530
Kouga said he's fighting monsters,

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:24.540
and he's putting himself in danger.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:28.750
He's still pretending to be a superhero!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.000
Let him do it.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:32.670
Is that what a parent would say?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:37.590
I'm the president of Amagi Corporation before a parent.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.010
So you're saying this is your home?

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.640
This country can't do anything without Amagi.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.520
Amagi is what rebuilt this country.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.850
My children come first before the country!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:52.860
Isn't protecting your children the job of a parent?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.860
Amagi comes before children.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:03.780
Of course we're going to strengthen the suit,

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.490
but we also need to improve the Cell Delete.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.750
In particular, we need to improve the strength of the blade.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:13.000
Ah, could you make it so I can fly in the sky?

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:15.380
Without using the Flying Hangar?

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.760
Yeah, I think the ability to fly is necessary.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:21.720
Well, we're researching it, but...

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.680
Do your best to make it a reality!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:25.390
Kouga-kun!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.520
Konoha-chan's gone!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.110
It's been a while since the sand monster's come out...

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:39.650
Huh?

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.990
You're the one who said it, Inspector!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.990
You said the criminal was a sand monster!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.410
Find an eye-witness.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.330
It's pointless...

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.410
What?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.710
What do you mean, "what"?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.420
It's just going to be swept under the rug at some point.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.870
It's always like that, isn't it?!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.670
Even so, we're doing it.

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.700
What're you do-

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.070
I was right! I just couldn't go back...

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.450
I can stay here, right?

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:26.780
I was told to not get close to anybody.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.290
Sorry I can't tell you about it in detail.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.040
But-

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.580
It's fine, I won't ask!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.920
I want to be with you!

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:36.750
You're the best!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:40.210
Everyone around me meets misfortune.

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:46.640
So I've tried to not get involved with the
people in this town as much as possible, too.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:49.470
Even so... It's weird...

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.640
I can't help being worried about you.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:57.650
But I thought I couldn't get close to you.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:01.990
I thought that you'd be safer if you went back to your home.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:05.910
You were lying when you said you'd come get me?

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.780
I didn't mean for it to be a lie.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:11.240
But, if you could be at ease back in your home,

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.750
I thought I'd be fine with that.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.330
I want to be here.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:19.000
I'm happy!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:23.010
I want us to... be a family!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:30.430
No matter what happens, I'll protect you!

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.020
I'll definitely protect you!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:49.870
Hello?

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:52.450
Good evening, Kouga-kun.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.410
You're...!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.660
You're looking for your little sister, right?

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.670
I know where she is.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:16.140
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:22.980
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:29.240
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:35.910
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:45.460
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.300
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:58.140
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:09.570
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:17.200
